unt owing at the end of the nth repayment.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.6681318681318681, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "(i) Find an expression for", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.4076923076923077, "y1": 0.3139083139083139}, {"text": "(ii) Show that A, = (5000 ~ 3M)1-01? - M(1 + 1-01)", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.3271173271173271, "x1": 0.6197802197802198, "y1": 0.351981351981352}, {"text": "(iii) Find an expression for Aye.", "x0": 0.17582417582417584, "y0": 0.36752136752136755, "x1": 0.44505494505494503, "y1": 0.3822843822843823}, {"text": "(iv) Find the value of M.", "x0": 0.17692307692307693, "y0": 0.40093240093240096, "x1": 0.3901098901098901, "y1": 0.4133644133644134}, {"text": "The first snow of the season begins to fall during the night. The depth of the", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.47241647241647244, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.48562548562548563}, {"text": "(b)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4731934731934732, "x1": 0.14175824175824175, "y1": 0.48484848484848486}, {"text": "snow, increases at a constant rate through the night and the following day.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5081585081585082}, {"text": "At 6am a snow plough begins to clear the road of snow. The speed, v knv/h,", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5097125097125097, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5337995337995338}, {"text": "of the snow plough is inversely proportional to the depth of snow. (This means", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5384615384615384, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5516705516705517}, {"text": "v where A is a constant.)", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5571095571095571, "x1": 0.4065934065934066, "y1": 0.5757575757575758}, {"text": "Let xkm be the distance the snow plough has cleared and let be the time", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.6013986013986014, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.6138306138306139}, {"text": "in hours from the beginning of the snowfall. Let t= T correspond to 6 am.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.616938616938617, "x1": 0.7714285714285715, "y1": 0.6301476301476302}, {"text": "(i) Explain carefully why, for 12 7,", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.6503496503496503, "x1": 0.4901098901098901, "y1": 0.6635586635586636}, {"text": "dx", "x0": 0.34395604395604396, "y0": 0.6752136752136753, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.6853146853146853}, {"text": "k", "x0": 0.389010989010989, "y0": 0.6752136752136753, "x1": 0.3978021978021978, "y1": 0.6853146853146853}, {"text": "\u2014-=\u2014, where k is a constant.", "x0": 0.34285714285714286, "y0": 0.6860916860916861, "x1": 0.5879120879120879, "y1": 0.696969696969697}, {"text": "dt ot", "x0": 0.34615384615384615, "y0": 0.6954156954156954, "x1": 0.3967032967032967, "y1": 0.7047397047397047}, {"text": "(ii) In the period from 6 am to 8 am the snow plough clears | km of road, but", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.7319347319347319, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.7451437451437452}, {"text": "it takes a further 3-5 hours to clear the next kilometre.", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.7482517482517482, "x1": 0.6604395604395604, "y1": 0.7583527583527584}, {"text": "At what time did it begin snowing?", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.7886557886557887, "x1": 0.512087912087912, "y1": 0.8018648018648019}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.8554778554778555, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.8686868686868687}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43846153846153846, "y0": 0.3543123543123543, "x1": 0.5615384615384615, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43846153846153846, "y0": 0.3543123543123543, "x1": 0.5615384615384615, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43846153846153846, "y0": 0.3543123543123543, "x1": 0.5615384615384615, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}], [{"text": "16", "x0": 0.49230769230769234, "y0": 0.041181041181041184, "x1": 0.5